      "The keeper who logs a failed chiller and slot four are exactly three slots apart in slot order.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The keeper who logs an algal bloom and Chiamaka are exactly one slot apart in slot order, in one direction or the other. (b) Chiamaka does not work slot two.",
