      "The keeper who tends the touch pool falls somewhere between Marisol and Oskar in slot order, matching neither.",
      "Chiamaka and the keeper who tends the jellyfish column are exactly one slot apart in slot order, in one direction or the other.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The keeper who tends the octopus enclosure is exactly one slot earlier than the keeper who logs a visitor's dropped phone, with no slot in between. (b) The keeper who logs a visitor's dropped phone tends the deep reef.",
      "Oskar falls somewhere between the keeper who logs an algal bloom and the keeper who logs an escapee in slot order, matching neither.",
      "The keeper who logs an algal bloom and the keeper who tends the touch pool are exactly two slots apart in slot order."
